# r1115 phase 4, boot A1: "SQ-SPD / SQ-SLK and Creative Delight fixes, 2026-11-14" (scratch_queue.md), server rows and
# reruns except SQ-DEP-02, SQ-MIN-03 (phase 7) and SQ-CDW-02 (p4_b1.qb, fresh group B world, last).
# Server: NOSWAP=1 prep_srv.sh OUT p4a1 A difficulty=normal (superflat, ground top y -61, stand at -60).
# Before boot, copy into OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/: hh_crow_probe.js (zhh3), hh_gear_probe.js (zhh5), zc4_probe.js
#   (zc4), c2_probe.js (zc2), zp_probe.js (zp), zact_probe.js (zact), each as zz_<name>; zq comes from prep_srv.sh.
# srv toml (qrun.py toml): hearthandharvest-common.toml [salt] saltLickInterval 200, saltSearchInterval 20,
#   saltAnimalStageChance 1.0 (Boot F style: SQ-HH-482, SQ-SLK-01 see a lick within the watch);
#   loadingprotection-common.toml '"Loading Protection Configuration"' protectionDuration 1.
# Fixtures copied from r1111/hh_gear_*.qb, hh_boot4.qb, hh_crow_d.qb, r1112/hh_gear.qb, hh_crow_rerun.qb,
# r1113/c2_a1.qb, fix_c2a1.qb, c4_ar2.qb. Seed container code: SeedContainerDispense (CD hearth member): the 5x5 is
# centred on the block in front (front air: the layer below it), so a horizontal dispenser stands inside its own 5x5.
pace 1

## P4-setup | gamerules, forceloads, bots (not a test row)
bootexpect Done \(
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> time set noon
> weather clear
> forceload add 470 460 620 620
> forceload add 700 490 720 570
> forceload add 796 496 820 526
> forceload add 296 356 316 376
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run forceload add 700 490 720 510
sleep 5
