sleep 3
> clear G
> zhh5 hand G
> zc4 cmd zhh3,zhh5,zc2,zc4,zp,zact,zq
waitlog \[zc4\] done 20
reject \[zc4\] cmd \w+ missing
look `[zhh5] hand id=minecraft:air`; no probe load error in the boot log

## SQ-SPD-01 | pouch x30 wheat facing air (east) over a 5x5 farmland layer: 24 or 25 wheat, itemCount 5 or 6
> fill 705 -60 495 715 -58 505 minecraft:air
> fill 709 -61 498 713 -61 502 minecraft:farmland
> setblock 710 -60 500 minecraft:dispenser[facing=east]
> data merge block 710 -60 500 {Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"quark:seed_pouch",Count:1b,tag:{storedItem:{id:"minecraft:wheat_seeds",Count:1b},itemCount:30}}]}
> setblock 710 -59 500 minecraft:redstone_block
sleep 2
> zq count 709 -60 498 713 -60 502 minecraft:wheat
> data get block 710 -60 500 Items
reject Exception
look row text: 25 wheat and itemCount 5. The dispenser itself stands in the 5x5 (centre 711, x 709..713), so the code can plant 24 at most here: 24 + itemCount 6 = code matches plan_bugfix_1114 1 (row text fault); pouch in slot 0

